# Pre-push quality gates

`pnpm check:push` (`scripts/pre-push-check.mjs`, also `.husky/pre-push`) runs lint/format/build/test for **directly changed** monitored packages, plus indexer checks when those paths change. `scripts/pre-push-check.mjs` enables App Playwright by default when `CURSOR_AGENT=1` and App CI paths change — the same production `next start` job as GitHub OnSocial App CI. `PRE_PUSH_E2E=0` skips that Playwright run and still runs lint/format/build. Laptop husky does not enable Playwright unless `PRE_PUSH_E2E=1`.

**Agents:** ordinary feature work is **typecheck + touched tests → push with `PRE_PUSH_E2E=0` → PR / GitHub CI + preview**. Do not use `--no-verify`; `PRE_PUSH_E2E=0` already skips Playwright while keeping lint/format/build. Full GitHub CI, including App CI Playwright, is the merge gate. On merge: ensure those PR checks are green, then merge — do not re-run `check:push`. See [cloud-quality-gates.mdc](cloud-quality-gates.mdc). Do not thrash the laptop with Playwright.

## When checks apply

Monitored packages under `packages/`:

- `@onsocial/rpc`, `@onsocial/text-card`, `@onsocial/sdk`, `@onsocial/ui`
- `onsocial-backend`, `onsocial-gateway`
- `@onsocial/pages`, `@onsocial/portal`, `@onsocial/app`

Indexer (prefer cloud):

- **SQL** — `indexers/chain-index/**/*.sql`, `scripts/validate_sql.sh`, `tests/fixtures/**` → `bash indexers/chain-index/scripts/validate_sql.sh` (Docker Postgres schema + upgrade)
- **Sink / golden** — `indexers/chain-index/src/**`, `tests/golden_db_fixtures.json`, `scripts/check_db_schema_parity.py`, `Cargo.toml` / `Cargo.lock` → `python3 scripts/check_db_schema_parity.py` + `cargo test golden_db` (same gap Indexer CI caught when SQL-only validate passed)

Diff base is `@{upstream}..HEAD`. Unrelated packages are skipped. Dependents expansion is **off** unless `PRE_PUSH_DEPENDENTS=1`.

Skip for docs-only, contract-only, or infra-only changes outside those paths. Contracts / relayer are separate.

## Commands

```bash
pnpm check:push
PRE_PUSH_DEPENDENTS=1 pnpm check:push   # after shared-lib changes
PRE_PUSH_E2E=0 pnpm check:push          # cloud agents: skip local Playwright (CI owns it)
PRE_PUSH_E2E=1 pnpm check:push          # force App Playwright locally
```

Prefer cloud for substreams Docker + Rust golden checks.

## Before committing

Pre-commit: `lint-staged` on staged monitored-package files (prettier + eslint --fix) — keep this local; it is light.

## CI

GitHub CI (including App CI Playwright) is the merge gate for PRs. Path-filtered workflows cover their own packages. Substreams CI runs full cargo test + SQL + parity.
